kind: llman.sdd.delta
ops[3]{op,req_id,title,statement,from,to,name}:
  modify_requirement,r1,demand/workflow YAML MUST support resources.books as unified Excel IO identity declaration,"系统 MUST 在 demand 与 workflow YAML 中提供一致的 resources.books 入口作为 Excel book 的 identity/variant/path 声明面: - demand: resources.books.<book_id> - workflow: workflow.resources.books.<book_id> - <book_id> MUST 非空且在 mapping 内唯一 - 每个 book MUST 选择且仅选择一个实现分支 xlsx_file 或 xlsx_memory - YAML books MUST NOT 再把 write_defaults 或 xlsx_memory.budget 作为稳定 authoring 字段（出现 MUST fail-fast 并迁移到 Python policy） - legacy kind discriminator 仍 MUST fail-fast - demand 侧 imports/ 规则保持既有 scope；workflow MUST NOT 支持 imports/",null,null,null
  modify_requirement,r3,xlsx_memory MUST define typed internal semantics and optional export; budget is Python policy,"系统 MUST 定义 resources.books.<id>.xlsx_memory 的 typed internal semantics 与可选 export_xlsx: - export_xlsx.path 等导出声明可留在 YAML - 内存预算 MUST 由 Python BookBudgetPolicy（或等价）表达，YAML MUST NOT 再 authoring xlsx_memory.budget - 当未提供 Python budget policy 时系统 MUST 视为 unlimited - internal rows MUST 保持 FieldValue SSOT（含 Decimal 不降级为 float） - allow_formulas 仍可按既有 YAML/variant 规则存在（本 change 不翻转默认值）",null,null,null
  modify_requirement,r8,"book write behavior MUST come from Python policy; outputs.write stays header-local","系统 MUST 以 Python BookWritePolicy 配置 book 级写入行为，并允许 outputs 仅覆盖展示/表头局部字段: - mode/align_by/header_policy/on_mismatch/on_conflict MUST 来自 Python policy（缺省用 builtin defaults） - YAML resources.books.<id>.write_defaults MUST NOT 再作为 authoring SSOT - outputs[*].write MAY 提供 include_header/header_fields_output_by 等 output-local header 行为 - outputs[*].write MUST NOT 承载 workbook 级 mode/align_by/header_policy/on_mismatch/on_conflict - xlsx_memory 在 append+align_by=header 时仍 MUST fail-fast",null,null,null
op_scenarios[3]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  r1,"yaml-write-defaults-rejected",YAML 声明 resources.books.report.xlsx_file.path 且同时声明 write_defaults,执行 schema 或 semantic validate,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并提示改用 Python BookWritePolicy"
  r3,"yaml-budget-rejected",YAML 声明 resources.books.report.xlsx_memory.budget,执行 validate 或 compile,"系统 MUST fail-fast 并提示改用 Python BookBudgetPolicy"
  r8,"python-policy-drives-mode",调用方设置 BookWritePolicy(mode=append) 且 YAML 无 write_defaults,两个 outputs 写入同一 sheet,系统 MUST 按 append 语义合并